{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamcrafter</strong> is a crafting and gathering <strong>Roguelite!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like risking your life, fighting big monsters to save people you don't even know? Of course not, you'd be crazy, right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyone knows how to fight, but you know how to craft !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/45aa842107a887949ffaae4bd4a594b5.avif?t=1773865867\" width=952 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamcrafter is an idea born from all the years spent on <strong>FFXIV Teamcraft</strong>, watching numerous crafters prepare big equipment for adventurers fighting, living their cozy life in nature, gathering resources, playing the way they wanted to play, while helping others, in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinite number of worlds to visit</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedural biomes, caves, plains, forests, swamps, deserts, snowy mountains, windy places, magical caves, lava worlds, and much more\u2026</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.poster.avif?t=1773865867\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.webm?t=1773865867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.mp4?t=1773865867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay to the infinity! More than a hundred collectables, over 40 talents, 50 passive items, even run is different, and it's just the beginning!</strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.poster.avif?t=1773865867\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.webm?t=1773865867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.mp4?t=1773865867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic fights with flashy spells, epic attacks, inspired from old JRPGs mixed with modern aethetics. Enjoy an automated turn-by-turn combat system with everything you need to monitor the fight, your party and help them succeed!</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.poster.avif?t=1773865867\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.webm?t=1773865867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.mp4?t=1773865867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app